      "content": "but that's the thing... it feels like there's nothing to step out into. even if i try to be noticed, it just feels fake or exhausting. like i'm performing for people who don't even want to look. honestly it feels more peaceful just to stop trying. like if i just gave up on everything, the quiet would finally be okay.",
